Prepare the {{ id | upper }}
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

#. Set jumper **{{ power.jumper }}** to {{ power.carrier }}, to power the SoM
   from the carrier board.
#. Set the boot mode switch **{{ boot.switch }}** to position
   {{ boot.jtag_position }}, so the processor waits to be bootstrapped over
   JTAG.

The serial console of the SoM is on its {{ uart }}.

{% if boot.switch != "S1" %}
.. important::

   :ref:`adsp setup` calls the boot mode switch S1. On the {{ id | upper }} it
   is **{{ boot.switch }}**. When the installer asks to change the boot mode,
   set {{ boot.switch }} to position {{ boot.flash_position }}.

{% endif %}
